      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    company_a_prices = [120, 125, 130, 128, 135, 138, 140, 142, 145, 147, 150, 152]\n    company_b_prices = [100, 105, 110, 107, 112, 115, 118, 120, 123, 125, 130, 132]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    n = len(company_a_prices)\n    sum_a = sum(company_a_prices)\n    sum_b = sum(company_b_prices)\n    sum_a_squared = sum(price ** 2 for price in company_a_prices)\n    sum_b_squared = sum(price ** 2 for price in company_b_prices)\n    sum_ab = sum(a * b for a, b in zip(company_a_prices, company_b_prices))\n\n    numerator = n * sum_ab - sum_a * sum_b\n    denominator = (\n        (n * sum_a_squared - sum_a ** 2)\n        * (n * sum_b_squared - sum_b ** 2)\n    ) ** 0.5\n\n    correlation_coefficient = numerator / denominator\n    answer = round(correlation_coefficient, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
